        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DWD-HPULL36-622, 36\" Matte Black Ladder Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Matte Black 36 Inch Ladder Pull is made from 304 stainless steel tubing with durable powder coating. It can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors ranging from 1/4 inches thick to 2-1/2 inches thick. This 3 foot door pull has 20 inch center to centers and a 1-1/4 inch diameter. It is a great choice for both commercial and residential applications. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-HPULL36-Specifications.gif?v=1704354501\" width=\"493\" height=\"137\" border=\"0\" alt=\"DWD-HPULL36-622 Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available in other lengths: <a href=\"/products/matte-black-24-inch-ladder-pull-dwd-hpull24-622\"><b>24\" Door Pull</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/48-inch-matte-black-ladder-pull-dwd-hpull48-622\"><b>48\" Door Pull</b></a> or <a href=\"/products/60-inch-black-ladder-pull-dwd-hpull60-622\"><b>60\" Black Door Pull</b></a> \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the DWD HPULL36-622 3 Foot Matte Black Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Matte Black</b></li> \r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 36\" (914 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 20\" (508 mm) </li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/8\" (80 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 1-1/4\" (32 mm) Round</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant Door Hardware</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Matte Black 36 Inch Ladder Pull, DWD-HPULL36-622",
                "description": "DWD-HPULL36-622, Matte Black 36 Inch Ladder Pull - The Matte Black 36 Inch Ladder Pull is made from 304 stainless steel tubing with durable powder coating. It can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, glass, or metal doors ranging from 1/4 inches thick to 2-1/2 inches thick. This 3 foot door pull has 20 inch center to centers and a 1-1/4 inch diameter. It is a great choice for both commercial and residential applications. \r\n",
